{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13204140","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13204140","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:4:1320414001:0":{"text":"Oh! It's beeping!","source_cn":"主人，格尔达女士！探测器响了！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x62552C7F7693B70B","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Oh! It's beeping!","female":"Oh! It's beeping!","variant_male_record_index":"145506","variant_female_record_index":"145507","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1320414002:0":{"text":"Huh... the sound's cutting in and out, and the temperature readings are all over the place.","source_cn":"咦……它的响声怎么断断续续的？显示屏上的温差也时有时无。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4C7F42BC1BB1DEAF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1320414003:0":{"text":"That's strange. A hot spring's heat should be steady, not fluctuating like this.","source_cn":"真奇怪，温泉和附近的温差应该是恒定的，不可能这样变来变去。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xADCC664EBEAE6816","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1320414004:1":{"text":"Do you think there's something wrong with the detector?","source_cn":"难不成是探测器不够准确？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9092D8C84D54B4DB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:8:1320414004":{"text":"Do you think there's something wrong with the detector?","source_cn":"难不成是探测器不够准确？",